BT /F1 10 Tf 56 580 Td (Card payments failed for 1,240 merchants over 56 minutes. payments-api returned errors to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 566 Td (merchants attempting to create payments. card-gateway experienced timeouts while waiting for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 552 Td (ledger writes to complete. notifications service delayed 18,400 webhooks to merchants about) Tj ET
