BT /F1 10 Tf 56 394 Td (CHG-1042 was approved by Ravi Patel and deployed to reduce ledger connection pool size as a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 380 Td (cost optimization. The change set max_connections from 200 to 20 without accounting for peak) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 366 Td (payment throughput. Under normal load, the reduced pool became exhausted, causing connection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 352 Td (timeouts across all services that depend on ledger writes. See INC-302 for card-gateway team's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 338 Td (preliminary report on authorization timeouts.) Tj ET
